@AssessmentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5024

### Login (Basic auth: Lawson01 / Password1)
POST {{AssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Authorization: Basic Lawson01 Password1

### Get all items
GET {{AssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/items
Accept: application/json

### Add an item
POST {{AssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Test Item",
  "description": "Added from the .http file"
}
